This project contains Rust ports of code from go-stellar-sdk
(https://github.com/stellar/go-stellar-sdk, commit f8efc493fca9, the version
pinned by stellar-horizon main on 2026-11-03), Copyright Stellar Development
Foundation and contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  - exp/orderbook/search.go, graph.go, edges.go, utils.go
      -> crates/core/src/paths.rs (search, processVenues, consumeOffers*,
         sortAndFilterPaths, positiveMin)
  - exp/orderbook/pools.go
      -> crates/core/src/pool_math.rs (CalculatePoolPayout,
         CalculatePoolExpectation, rounding slippage)
  - price/main.go
      -> crates/core/src/price.rs (MulFractionRoundDown, mulFractionRoundUp,
         ConvertToBuyingUnits)

Behaviour (not code) is also mirrored from stellar-horizon
(https://github.com/stellar/stellar-horizon, Apache-2.0):
internal/db2/history/orderbook.go, internal/db2/history/trade_aggregation.go,
internal/ingest/processors/trades_processor.go, internal/actions/path.go.

The ports were translated by hand from Go to Rust; changes are described in
SPEC.md section 5. The upstream Apache-2.0 licence text applies to those
portions: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
